[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2765980577","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104381#issuecomment-2765980577","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104381","id":2765980577,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6k3YOh","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-31T11:45:44Z","updated_at":"2025-03-31T11:45:51Z","body":"@lawnjelly This one might be worth backporting to 3.x as well.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2765980577/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768488509","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104381#issuecomment-2768488509","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104381","id":2768488509,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lA8g9","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T07:49:04Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T07:49:04Z","body":"> I would love to see the different assembly for the two versions to get a real sense of where the speed up occurs (and what is the bottleneck for this function), but that's probably tough to get.\r\n\r\nIt should be possible to set it up in GodBolt, but without it my guess is:\r\n- Fewer parameters means less data copied around\r\n- Fewer parameters means fewer registers juggled (internally)\r\n- No `if` means perfectly predictable code\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768488509/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768524744","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104381#issuecomment-2768524744","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104381","id":2768524744,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lBFXI","user":{"login":"kiroxas","id":3176062,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxNzYwNjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3176062?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas","html_url":"https://github.com/kiroxas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiroxas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T08:03:42Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T08:03:42Z","body":"> > I would love to see the different assembly for the two versions to get a real sense of where the speed up occurs (and what is the bottleneck for this function), but that's probably tough to get.\r\n> \r\n> It should be possible to set it up in GodBolt, but without it my guess is:\r\n> \r\n> * Fewer parameters means less data copied around\r\n> * Fewer parameters means fewer registers juggled (internally)\r\n> * No `if` means perfectly predictable code\r\n\r\nYes, I understand that one of those may be the bottleneck. There is not really any copies in relase build for parameters, but you need to have your parameter in a specific register ( it's unlikely that's it's spilled to the stack with so few parameters). That is a register to register move if it needs to juggle it around, and that's the cheapest move (often handled by the front end entirely, the backend does not see the instruction). You still have an if at the root of your call, but that's less that there was, so maybe the compiler had a hard time figuring it out and had some branch mispredictions. All in all, that's a pretty big speed up for a small change in my opinion, so that means you probably removed pressure on the bottleneck for this code (which is very good 👍 ), I just think it would be nice to know what that bottleneck was. (but we can totally merge this without it)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768524744/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768534534","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104381#issuecomment-2768534534","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104381","id":2768534534,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lBHwG","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T08:07:41Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T08:07:41Z","body":"> I just think it would be nice to know what that bottleneck was.\r\n\r\nI agree, i was equally surprised this was having such a measurable effect. Branch mispredictions should only have a few tens of cycles of cost. I was just expanding on @CrazyRoka's idea with this one, otherwise i would probably not have proposed it 😄","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768534534/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768649368","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104381#issuecomment-2768649368","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104381","id":2768649368,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lBjyY","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T08:51:49Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T08:51:49Z","body":"Just to fill in here while @Ivorforce is adding a few more comments.\r\n\r\nI was a little confused I'll admit as I wasn't familiar with the existing plumbing for notifications, and some of the (existing) code was a little esoteric. So I suggested now would be a good time to add a few comments if we can, as this area is not easy to follow.\r\n\r\nI got Lukas to walk me through it and I'm satisfied it should work the same as before. It is kind of hard to read and work out what is going on because the logic is kind of complex in this area, but I guess it is \"core core\" so there's a little flexibility with the general approach of being easy to follow.\r\n\r\nOverall it's a pretty ingenious way of handling at much as possible at compile time, using the `GDCLASS` recursive macros.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768649368/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768891988","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104381#issuecomment-2768891988","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104381","id":2768891988,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lCfBU","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T10:21:32Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T10:21:32Z","body":"Need to quickly double check the notification order","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768891988/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768960066","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104381#issuecomment-2768960066","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104381","id":2768960066,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lCvpC","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T10:49:39Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T10:50:56Z","body":"Ok, looks like I had a behavior change afterall.\r\n\r\nMy implementation ran this order for forward:\r\n`script -> extension -> Object -> Node -> Node3D`\r\nBut it should be this:\r\n`Object -> Node -> Node3D -> extension -> script`\r\n\r\nI've fixed this; it required having dedicated `Object` functions after all.\r\nOn the bright side, it's a bit less 'magic' again now, should be easier to understand the change :)\r\n\r\nI'm pretty sure the order should be correct now. It might be good to have a unit test for this, but then again, it's unlikely the functions will change much again after this and the unit test might be a bit complicated.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768960066/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768964628","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104381#issuecomment-2768964628","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104381","id":2768964628,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lCwwU","user":{"login":"lawnjelly","id":21999379,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxOTk5Mzc5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21999379?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly","html_url":"https://github.com/lawnjelly","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lawnjelly/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T10:51:42Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T10:55:07Z","body":"Ah that neatly solves the problem we had of the `GDCLASS` macro having the same name as the object function and adding to the confusion.\r\n\r\nWith changes like this it is always good idea to run a bunch of the demos just to check for any regressions, even if a unit test is too difficult.\r\n\r\nIt might be an idea to debug log the order of notifications before and after (in a minimum project) and check they are the same, if you haven't done this already.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2768964628/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2769110036","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104381#issuecomment-2769110036","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104381","id":2769110036,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lDUQU","user":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T11:54:11Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T11:54:11Z","body":"> I'm pretty sure the order should be correct now. It might be good to have a unit test for this, but then again, it's unlikely the functions will change much again after this and the unit test might be a bit complicated.\r\n\r\nWe've actually touched this code surprisingly frequently in recent years (mostly for GDExtension but not only), so a unit test would be great yes.\r\n\r\nWe actually have one here, so the fact that it didn't catch this error is a problem that needs to be solved: \r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/cc7217970d02b84122b59569cf7ed3b52cf815a6/tests/core/object/test_object.h#L467-L533","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2769110036/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2769364770","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104381#issuecomment-2769364770","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104381","id":2769364770,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lESci","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-01T13:28:11Z","updated_at":"2025-04-01T13:41:23Z","body":"Oh, good! Thanks for linking :)\r\n\r\nI added a script order test, this would have caught my PR in its incorrect state.\r\nThe test still missing a GDExtension order check, but I didn't find any boilerplate for that, so I hope it's ok to omit that for the moment. The important part is that the 'Object' defined handlers come after the most derived handlers in the forward pass (and vice versa for the backwards pass).","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2769364770/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2771004413","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104381#issuecomment-2771004413","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104381","id":2771004413,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lKiv9","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-02T01:00:41Z","updated_at":"2025-04-02T01:00:41Z","body":"Thanks!","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2771004413/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]